function [jo, pd] = inertia_products(j, f)
%INERTIA_PRODUCTS  The inertia with products of inertia f = [xy, xz, yz], each a fraction of sqrt(I_ii I_jj) (each below 1 in size), and
%   whether it is still positive definite (its leading 2 x 2 minor and its determinant above 0).
%   j: real[1][3][3] (passed a plain number)
%   f: real[1][3] (passed a plain number)
